<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply higher in moderate trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 52.90 to 5659.86.</p>
<p>For the week, it was up 43.65 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 3.03 to 352.67.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.33.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1645 to 693.</p>
<p>Volume was 348,682,480, compared with 360,544,230 Thursday.</p>
